 "caps": [
  {
   "text": "A coworker texts you.",
   "start": 0.82,
   "end": 2.47,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "Honest question.",
   "start": 2.78,
   "end": 3.51,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "If God is good,",
   "start": 3.86,
   "end": 4.99,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "why does my sister have cancer?",
   "start": 5.1,
   "end": 6.83,
   "line": "L1"
  },
  {
   "text": "What do you type back?",
   "start": 7.34,
   "end": 8.45,
   "line": "L2"
  },
  {
   "text": "Most of us freeze.",
   "start": 11.04,
   "end": 12.39,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Not because we don't believe,",
   "start": 12.72,
   "end": 14.25,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "but because we've never practiced",
   "start": 14.58,
   "end": 15.73,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "saying it out loud,",
   "start": 15.76,
   "end": 16.71,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "to someone who pushes back.",
   "start": 16.74,
   "end": 18.75,
   "line": "L3"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pilots train in simulators.",
   "start": 19.18,
   "end": 20.77,
   "line": "L4"
  },
  {
   "text": "Surgeons practice on models.",
   "start": 21.2,
   "end": 22.75,
   "line": "L4"
  },
  {
   "text": "So where do Christians practice",
   "start": 23.04,
   "end": 24.27,
   "line": "L4"
  },
  {
   "text": "the hardest conversations",
   "start": 24.3,
   "end": 25.53,
   "line": "L4"
  },
  {
   "text": "about faith?",
   "start": 25.56,
   "end": 26.57,
   "line": "L4"
  },
  {
   "text": "So we built Apologist Academy.",
   "start": 40.54,
   "end": 42.85,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "A safe place to practice",
   "start": 43.04,
   "end": 44.31,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "the hard questions,",
   "start": 44.34,
   "end": 45.65,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "before someone asks you for real.",
   "start": 45.68,
   "end": 47.37,
   "line": "L7"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pick one of sixteen questions",
   "start": 47.64,
   "end": 48.97,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "across eight topics,",
   "start": 49,
   "end": 50.49,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "from suffering to science",
   "start": 50.6,
   "end": 52.11,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "to other faiths.",
   "start": 52.14,
   "end": 53.01,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "No account.",
   "start": 53.3,
   "end": 54.13,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nothing to install.",
   "start": 54.22,
   "end": 55.33,
   "line": "L8"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then choose who you're talking to.",
   "start": 55.76,
   "end": 57.77,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Curious asks honest questions.",
   "start": 58.18,
   "end": 60.15,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hostile pushes hard,",
   "start": 60.54,
   "end": 61.85,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "but stays civil.",
   "start": 61.88,
   "end": 62.97,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "And you set how hard it pushes.",
   "start": 63.18,
   "end": 64.99,
   "line": "L9"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now you talk it through,",
   "start": 65.26,
   "end": 66.23,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "for five turns.",
   "start": 66.26,
   "end": 67.77,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "Type your reply,",
   "start": 67.92,
   "end": 68.61,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "or just speak it.",
   "start": 68.64,
   "end": 70.09,
   "line": "L10"
  },
  {
   "text": "The skeptic isn't reading",
   "start": 70.14,
   "end": 71.33,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "from a script.",
   "start": 71.36,
   "end": 72.35,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "It answers what you actually said.",
   "start": 72.48,
   "end": 74.55,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pick a tougher skeptic,",
   "start": 74.72,
   "end": 75.83,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "and it won't let a vague answer slide.",
   "start": 75.86,
   "end": 78.01,
   "line": "L11"
  },
  {
   "text": "Stuck? Ask Coach.",
   "start": 78.52,
   "end": 80.27,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "It helps in steps.",
   "start": 80.48,
   "end": 81.69,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "First a hint.",
   "start": 81.9,
   "end": 82.85,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then an outline.",
   "start": 82.98,
   "end": 84.23,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a sample reply,",
   "start": 84.48,
   "end": 85.77,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "only if you want it.",
   "start": 85.8,
   "end": 87.01,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "The goal is to find your own words.",
   "start": 87.06,
   "end": 89.29,
   "line": "L12"
  },
  {
   "text": "Because this isn't a debate to win.",
   "start": 93.37,
   "end": 95.64,
   "line": "L13"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a person to listen to.",
   "start": 95.95,
   "end": 97.64,
   "line": "L13"
  },
  {
   "text": "After five turns,",
   "start": 98,
   "end": 99.39,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Coach writes you a short review.",
   "start": 99.42,
   "end": 101.05,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "What you covered,",
   "start": 101.26,
   "end": 102.07,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "what you could add,",
   "start": 102.1,
   "end": 103.09,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "and a verse to study.",
   "start": 103.12,
   "end": 104.33,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "No scores. No grades.",
   "start": 104.5,
   "end": 106.27,
   "line": "L14"
  },
  {
   "text": "Print it,",
   "start": 106.56,
   "end": 106.83,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "and bring it to your small group.",
   "start": 106.86,
   "end": 108.45,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "It doesn't replace your church.",
   "start": 108.6,
   "end": 110.25,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "It helps you get ready",
   "start": 110.42,
   "end": 111.25,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "for real conversations.",
   "start": 111.28,
   "end": 112.79,
   "line": "L15"
  },
  {
   "text": "And it works on any screen.",
   "start": 113.16,
   "end": 115.13,
   "line": "L16"
  },
  {
   "text": "We built it carefully.",
   "start": 117.51,
   "end": 118.9,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "The AI is always labeled.",
   "start": 119.19,
   "end": 121.42,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "The skeptic never pretends",
   "start": 121.45,
   "end": 122.72,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "to be converted,",
   "start": 122.75,
   "end": 123.7,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "and never insults you or your faith.",
   "start": 123.73,
   "end": 125.92,
   "line": "L17"
  },
  {
   "text": "If someone seems to be in crisis,",
   "start": 126.19,
   "end": 127.82,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "it stops the exercise",
   "start": 127.91,
   "end": 129.04,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "and points them to real help.",
   "start": 129.07,
   "end": 130.98,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "And Coach quotes one checked verse,",
   "start": 131.13,
   "end": 132.64,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "and never makes up sources.",
   "start": 132.67,
   "end": 134.48,
   "line": "L18"
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the hood,",
   "start": 135.25,
   "end": 136.2,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "our server sets the rules:",
   "start": 136.29,
   "end": 137.98,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "five turns,",
   "start": 138.15,
   "end": 139.02,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "separate instructions for each role,",
   "start": 139.19,
   "end": 140.92,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "and a daily limit.",
   "start": 140.95,
   "end": 142.18,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Apologist Project's AI platform",
   "start": 142.41,
   "end": 144.28,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "plays the skeptic",
   "start": 144.31,
   "end": 145.34,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "and powers Coach and the review,",
   "start": 145.37,
   "end": 147.18,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "with memory turned off.",
   "start": 147.21,
   "end": 148.64,
   "line": "L19"
  },
  {
   "text": "It's for small groups,",
   "start": 148.81,
   "end": 149.98,
   "line": "L20"
  },
  {
   "text": "students, new believers,",
   "start": 150.01,
   "end": 151.62,
   "line": "L20"
  },
  {
   "text": "and church leaders",
   "start": 151.71,
   "end": 152.36,
   "line": "L20"
  },
  {
   "text": "training their people.",
   "start": 152.39,
   "end": 153.58,
   "line": "L20"
  },
  {
   "text": "So the next time someone asks,",
   "start": 154.57,
   "end": 156.3,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "you won't freeze.",
   "start": 156.45,
   "end": 157.52,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "You'll be ready,",
   "start": 157.77,
   "end": 158.42,
   "line": "L21"
  },
  {
   "text": "with gentleness and respect.",
   "start": 158.45,
   "end": 160.7,
   "line": "L21"
  }
 ],
